{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34310","headline":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 四 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美见题郊居十首因次韵酬之以伸荣谢 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故山空自掷，当路竟谁知。\n祗有经时策，全无养拙资。\n病深怜灸客，炊晚信樵儿。\n谩欲陈风俗，周官未采诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}